{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27271","headline":"初及第归酬孟元翊见赠 · 章孝标","name":"初及第归酬孟元翊见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六年衣破帝城尘，一日天池水脱鳞。\n未有片言惊後辈，不无慙色见同人。\n每登公讌思来日，渐听乡音认本身。\n何幸致诗相慰贺，东归花发杏桃春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}